      "content": "i get that, but honestly, from a planning perspective, aren't a lot of these arguments just objectively bad for the economy and housing affordability? it feels like people are prioritizing their own views over the actual needs of the city. is there a way to frame the debate where it's clear that the density side is just the more logical, evidence-based path?",
